__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/
# Datasets and results never live in the repo: they are per-machine and reach
# the code through env vars (see repro/shadowkv/env_m*.sh).
# ONE exception, repro/shadowkv/data/reasoning/ (332 kB): AIME25/MATH500/GPQA
# must be byte-identical on every machine or their cells cannot be merged, and
# the per-machine copies did drift -- see that directory's README.
# Trailing slash matches a directory only. Each machine links this at its own
# RULER store, and a committed symlink would carry one machine's absolute path
# into every checkout -- which is exactly what happened on 2026-09-13.
ShadowKV/data/ruler
ShadowKV/data/ruler/
results*/
_archive*/
